    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d443">

                <pb facs="0616" n="520" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg520"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Tyler to acting British consul-general.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-04-14"><hi rendition="#italic">April 14,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 5.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Foreign minister has telegraphed to Emir-i-Nizam to release Bagdasarian. Shall be
                    glad to know if it is done.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
